sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant Z as Zitadel
    participant A as APISIX
    participant O as OPA
    participant N as Node app

    C->>Z: POST /oauth/v2/token (client_credentials, project aud scope)
    Z-->>C: JWT access token
    C->>A: POST /api/hello (Authorization: Bearer JWT)
    A->>Z: discovery + JWKS (cached)
    A->>A: verify signature, iss, exp
    alt invalid or missing token
        A-->>C: 401
    end
    A->>O: POST /v1/data/apisix/authz {method, path, headers, route}
    O->>O: project = data.routes[route.id], roles = data.server_roles[project][sub]
    alt sub in data.blocked
        O-->>A: allow = false, reason
        A-->>C: 403 user blocked
    end
    alt GET, or writer role present
        O-->>A: allow = true, headers.X-Roles
        A->>N: forward + X-Access-Token + X-Roles
        N-->>A: 200 JSON
        A-->>C: 200
    else no writer role on a write
        O-->>A: allow = false, reason
        A-->>C: 403 writer role required
    end
